{"id":"439523","name":"豆腐银鱼羹","author":"小耿妈妈","authorId":"407931","desc":"","cover":"images/439523/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"豆腐","amount":"1盒"},{"name":"银鱼","amount":"100克"},{"name":"黑木耳","amount":"少许"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"1只"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"姜","amount":"1块"},{"name":"胡椒粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"老抽","amount":"半勺"},{"name":"醋","amount":"半勺"},{"name":"水淀粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备的原料。","img":"images/439523/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"开水中加盐，将豆腐丝，汆烫几十秒。","img":"images/439523/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"黑木耳和银鱼同样分别汆水。","img":"images/439523/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"热锅凉油，煸香姜末。","img":"images/439523/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加入豆腐，黑木耳，银鱼。","img":"images/439523/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入清水，老抽烧开。","img":"images/439523/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入盐，醋调匀。","img":"images/439523/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"淋上少许的水淀粉拌匀烧开。","img":"images/439523/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"再淋入鸡蛋液烧开。","img":"images/439523/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"最后撒上胡椒粉，葱花就可以。","img":"images/439523/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"1.醋的量不要多，微微有点酸就可以。\n2.老抽主要起个上色的作用。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：汤锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}